			(property "Description" "500 mW Rating on FR-4 or FR-5 Board; Wide Zener Reverse Voltage Range - 1.8 V to 43 V; Package Designed for Optimal Automated Board Assembly; Small Package Size for High Density Applications; ESD Rating of Class 3 (exceeding 16 kV) per the Human Body Model Mechanical Characteristics:; CASE: Void-free, transfer-molded, thermosetting plastic case; FINISH: Corrosion resistant finish, easily solderable; MAXIMUM CASE TEMPERATURE FOR SOLDERING PURPOSES: 260?C for 10 Seconds; POLARITY: Cathode indicated by polarit"
